{
  "bodyHash": "rU2Tvizg594=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">這個模組簡單地增加了更多符合原版風格的武器類型。本模組注重質量而非數量，<del>雖然沒有添加大量武器</del>，但每種武器都帶來獨特的新玩法。目前包含8種新武器，其中7種具有特殊能力。*可在配置中禁用特殊能力</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">這些武器是圍繞<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\">Better Combat</a>模組進行平衡的，但您也可以單獨使用本模組。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果您曾玩過此模組並想協助平衡，請填寫這份簡短問卷。(感謝)</p>\n<p>https://forms.gle/xzawb9UWQXDse59u9</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><strong>武器介紹</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>鐮刀：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KeikcPj.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：慢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：極遠 *Better Combat數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*造成流血效果，隨時間造成傷害，更高級的鐮刀會延長流血時間</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>巨劍：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JBhp5oz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：高</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：慢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：遠 *Better Combat數值</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>長矛：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/idYcdKW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：極高</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：極慢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：極遠 *Better Combat數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*騎乘時增加傷害</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>匕首：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iJuHMWb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：極低</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：極快</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：極近 *Better Combat數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*背刺：對未察覺的目標造成額外傷害並使其踉蹌</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*擊退效果較弱</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>卡達：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BKEh0SD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：中高</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：中慢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：極近 *Better Combat數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*具有生命偷取效果，基於擊中敵人數而非造成傷害</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>彎刀：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/h0b8SbV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：低中</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：中快</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：中等 *Better Combat數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*復仇：根據失去的生命值增加傷害，更高級的彎刀增幅更大</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*鋒利附魔不與復仇效果疊加，取兩者中傷害較高者</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>鴉嘴鉤：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uGLy9gl.png\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：中等 *Better Combat數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*致殘：使目標緩速1秒</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*破甲：對穿戴護甲的目標造成額外傷害</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>武士刀：</strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EIipFON.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：中等 *Better Combat數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*鬥志：每次擊中增加攻擊速度</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>開發中武器：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em>*這些武器可能不會加入模組，一切尚未定案</em></span></p>\n<br />\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>爪刃</strong> - 低傷害，擊中目標後獲得短暫速度提升，連續擊中可疊加效果(有上限)。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">單手武器</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>雙刀</strong> - 中等傷害，擊殺目標後獲得傷害加成，若短時間內連續擊殺可疊加效果</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>戰斧&nbsp;</strong>- 中高傷害，傷害可無視盾牌且不受藥水效果影響，對同一目標連續攻擊會造成流血</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;所有效果都可能變更，若有任何想法或建議請告訴我！</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><strong>兼容性</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\">Better Combat</a> - 所有武器都使用該模組的動畫和數值系統</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-corinthium\">Simple Corinthium</a> - 新增科林斯合金版本的武器</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ogfTkBm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oreganized\">Oreganized</a> - 新增銀金合金版本的武器</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4O10gxV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\" /></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a> - 新增潘朵拉石版本的武器</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A5IQZFJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\" /></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\">Deeper and Darker</a> - 新增幽匿版本的武器</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CedGhpK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\" /></p>\n<p>此模組僅限1.19.2版本</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enlightened-end\">Enlightened End</a> - 新增精金版本的武器</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/71G15Z0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\" /></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\">Twilight Forest</a> - 新增鐵木、鋼葉、騎士金屬和熾焰版本的武器</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ZCCQS5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3zlCG7a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A2ERkx9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y5gLbdA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>待辦兼容清單：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">我計劃為所有流行且新增工具組的模組添加兼容性。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>當前待辦清單：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Stalwart Dungeons</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Blue Skies</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Aquaculture 2</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Buddy Cards&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Upgraded Netherite</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forbidden and Arcanus</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Majrusz's Progressive Difficulty</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">LieonLion's Enderite</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Plus the End</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Create Addons (Alloyed,&nbsp;Stuff &amp; Additions)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Enderite Mod</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Copper Armor &amp; Tools</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Spirit</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">End's Phantasm</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Frosted Friends</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Additional Additions</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果您希望兼容的模組不在清單中，請告訴我。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><strong>常見問題</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>能否更新至最新版本？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 可以，但更新需要時間，將在我有空時進行</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>能否降級至X版本？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 不行，1.18.2是最低支援版本</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>能否新增X武器？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 可能。標準是必須具有獨特性或填補某個空缺</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>能否新增與X模組的兼容性？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 大多數情況下可以，但請不要期待能快速完成</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>不裝Better Combat能使用嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 可以，但平衡性可能受影響</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>能否將此模組用於我的整合包？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 可以</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>查看我的其他模組：</strong></span></p>\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-corinthium\"><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1fS6nzK.png\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
